  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha">
        <tei:p><tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">If you wish to pray for the recovery of a sick person, you may do so here.</tei:note><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/1"/>May it be Your will,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/2"/>Adonoy, our God, and the God of our fathers,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/3"/>that You send, quickly,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/4"/>a complete recovery from the heavens,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/5"/>healing for the soul,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/6"/>and healing for the body,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/7"/>for the ailing
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/8"/>(<tei:hi rend="italic">name</tei:hi>)
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/9"/>son/daughter of
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/10"/>(<tei:hi rend="italic">mother's name</tei:hi>)
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/11"/>among the ailing of Israel.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/12"/>because You are the Almighty, King,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/13"/>Who is a faithful and merciful Healer.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/14"/>Blessed are You, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milfanekha/15"/>Healer of the sick of His people Israel.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
